{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"Hearing an all-too-familiar voice, the nameless rushes to the entrance of the ship. Upon seeing his captain he immediately grabs her in a tight hug. He keeps the hug for a few memonts before awkwardly pulling back. He looks down at the ground, surprised at his sudden action. \"Oh.. uhh.. welcome back, cap'n.\" He tries for a casual greet.","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:33:26.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867761258005921892","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
