{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"So, what's this I heard about you becoming.... Voice of the Dead? Something or other?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:35:36.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867761806894301224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"The nameless laughs as he gets lifted by the much stronger Irynx. \"Put me down first and then I'll tell you what happened.\" He says with a big smile.","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:38:19.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867762486634872852","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Sure thing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:39:25.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867762764264636426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Well... tell me the tale.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:41:45.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867763352201986078","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"All right, all right.\" The nameless regains his footing as he fixes the crinkles of his shirt. \"The list Gaillardia gave to bring you back had a colorless feather. I went to the ravens to ask for one and when I did this thunderbird came and gave me a crystalline feather from it's eyes. And the price for that deal was me working for the ravens basically. I don't spread their faith or something, but I will now be the Speaker for the Dead.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:42:12.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867763466849091604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"They gave me a fancy title and new magic to go along with it!\" The nameless adds excitedly.","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:42:36.588000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867763566782578698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\".........That's so stupid. You could have picked up a feather from some random bird.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:42:58.504000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867763658704551937","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"Don't get me wrong, I'm glad you've found a calling.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:43:10.458000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867763708842737724","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"But, for that? Seriously?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:43:26.259000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867763775116673075","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"866825622390702090","content":"\"You know me cap, I only do the most dramatic things. I was distraught that you died because I couldn't help you, I saw colorless and feather and my mind went to the ravens, and it was basically history from that point.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T13:44:18.571000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867763994530021416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
